WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.945
PETE:  GO AHEAD, SORRY.

00:00:02.979 --> 00:00:04.897
JEDEDIAH:  POWERFUL MESSAGES

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.119
FROM PEOPLE IN SACRAMENTO,

00:00:06.121 --> 00:00:06.535
CALIFORNIA.

00:00:06.536 --> 00:00:08.335
WE’RE SEEING PROTESTS POP UP

00:00:08.336 --> 00:00:09.400
AROUND THE COUNTRY.

00:00:09.434 --> 00:00:10.532
CALIFORNIA MAKING SOME PRETTY

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:11.575
STRONG STATEMENTS THERE.

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:15.224
WE’RE GOING TO BRING IN

00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:18.226
CALIFORNIA GOP CONGRESSMAN DEVIN

00:00:18.261 --> 00:00:19.261
NEWNUNES NOW.

00:00:19.295 --> 00:00:21.710
WHAT IS YOUR REACTION TO

00:00:21.744 --> 00:00:23.053
MATTERING THE COMMENTS FROM

00:00:23.087 --> 00:00:23.860
PROTESTERS IN CALIFORNIA?

00:00:23.861 --> 00:00:25.370
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT’S GOING TO GET A

00:00:25.371 --> 00:00:26.207
LOT WORSE.

00:00:26.241 --> 00:00:28.033
THE GOVERNOR IS PICKING WINNERS

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.617
AND LOSERS ON A DAILY BASIS.

00:00:29.618 --> 00:00:32.357
WE’VE BEEN TALKING ABOUT THIS

00:00:32.358 --> 00:00:34.355
FOR SEVERAL WEEKS NOW WITH WHERE

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:35.728
BEACHES ARE OPEN, OTHER BEACHES

00:00:35.729 --> 00:00:36.829
ARE NOT.

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:38.443
WHAT HAPPENED YESTERDAY, I WENT

00:00:38.477 --> 00:00:40.729
TO COSTCO WHICH I LIKE TO DO.

00:00:40.763 --> 00:00:42.940
THE LINES WERE LONGER THAN I’VE

00:00:42.974 --> 00:00:44.525
SEEN LINES AT DISNEYLAND.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.605
I STOOD IN THE LINE FOR 30

00:00:46.639 --> 00:00:47.889
MINUTES TO GET MY FOOD.

00:00:47.891 --> 00:00:50.420
THERE WERE HUNDREDS AND HUNDREDS

00:00:50.421 --> 00:00:52.608
OF MY FELLOW CALIFORNIANS THERE.

00:00:52.609 --> 00:00:54.343
AND I’M ALL FOR COSTCO BEING

00:00:54.344 --> 00:00:54.838
OPEN.

00:00:54.873 --> 00:00:57.158
WHEN I FINALLY GOT TO THE

00:00:57.159 --> 00:00:58.826
CHECKOUT COUNTER, I HAD PICKED

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:00.534
UP LAMB AND CHICKEN.

00:01:00.568 --> 00:01:03.418
I WAS TOLD I COULD ONLY BUY

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:04.927
THREE PACKAGES.

00:01:04.962 --> 00:01:07.981
SO I SENT THE CHICKEN BACK, TOOK

00:01:08.016 --> 00:01:08.892
WITH THE LAMB.

00:01:08.926 --> 00:01:10.639
NOT THAT THE VIEWERS WANT TO

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:11.850
KNOW WHAT I HAD FOR DINNER LAST

00:01:11.885 --> 00:01:12.590
NIGHT.

00:01:12.624 --> 00:01:15.503
BUT I JUST THINK THIS IS

00:01:15.504 --> 00:01:16.262
LUDICROUS.

00:01:16.297 --> 00:01:19.199
THE GOVERNOR NOW IS TREATING

00:01:19.234 --> 00:01:20.474
DIFFERENT COUNTIES, COUNTIES

00:01:20.475 --> 00:01:22.180
THAT HAVE VOTED TO SAY, HEY,

00:01:22.214 --> 00:01:23.641
WE’RE GOING TO OPEN UP, THEY’RE

00:01:23.675 --> 00:01:24.491
BEING PUNISHED.

00:01:24.492 --> 00:01:27.117
I TALKED TO A COUPLE OF OUR

00:01:27.118 --> 00:01:28.693
LOCAL CITY COUNCIL AND ELECTED

00:01:28.694 --> 00:01:30.251
OFFICIALS YESTERDAY AND THEY

00:01:30.252 --> 00:01:31.712
TOLD ME THAT THEY’RE BEING

00:01:31.747 --> 00:01:33.364
INTIMIDATED BY THE GOVERNOR AND

00:01:33.398 --> 00:01:34.653
HIS STAFF.

00:01:34.687 --> 00:01:37.494
NOW, TO ME, THAT’S EXTORTION.

00:01:37.529 --> 00:01:39.933
YOU CAN’T USE FEDERAL AND STATE

00:01:39.934 --> 00:01:42.307
TAX DOLLARS WHERE YOU DISAGREE

00:01:42.342 --> 00:01:43.839
WITH SOMEONE’S POLICIES OR

00:01:43.873 --> 00:01:45.707
POLITICS AND PUNISH THEM.

00:01:45.741 --> 00:01:47.565
AND REMEMBER, THIS IS WHEN

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:48.672
NEIGHBORING COUNTIES ARE WIDE

00:01:48.673 --> 00:01:50.468
OPEN, THE RESTAURANTS ARE OPEN.

00:01:50.469 --> 00:01:52.006
SO THIS IS BECOMING -- IT’S

00:01:52.007 --> 00:01:54.158
GETTING WORSE AND WORSE AND

00:01:54.159 --> 00:01:55.486
WORSE AND I THINK IT’S VERY,

00:01:55.487 --> 00:01:57.005
VERY FRUSTRATING FOR A LOT OF

00:01:57.006 --> 00:01:57.961
FOLKS IN CALIFORNIA.

00:01:57.996 --> 00:02:00.145
GRIFF:  TALK ABOUT FRUSTRATING.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:02.234
WE WANT TO BRING IN RYAN

00:02:02.235 --> 00:02:05.263
DRISCOLL, A PERFORMER ON THE

00:02:05.297 --> 00:02:06.881
CRUISE SHIP SEA BORNE ODYSSEY.

00:02:06.915 --> 00:02:08.905
GOOD MORNING TO YOU.

00:02:08.906 --> 00:02:11.279
I UNDERSTAND YOU WERE STUCK ON

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:13.460
THAT SHIP FOR SOME 80 DAYS

00:02:13.461 --> 00:02:14.741
DURING THE PANDEMIC, IS THAT

00:02:14.742 --> 00:02:15.166
CORRECT?

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:16.478
&gt;&gt; THAT’S CORRECT.

00:02:16.479 --> 00:02:18.742
IT WAS A CRAZY TIME.

00:02:18.743 --> 00:02:21.230
GRIFF:  CONGRESSMAN NUNES HELPED

00:02:21.231 --> 00:02:22.155
BRING YOU HOME.

00:02:22.157 --> 00:02:22.820
EXPLAIN.

00:02:22.854 --> 00:02:25.990
&gt;&gt; YES, I’M VERY THANKFUL TO

00:02:26.025 --> 00:02:27.260
CONGRESSMAN NUNES AND HIS

00:02:27.262 --> 00:02:27.800
OFFICE.

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:30.375
THEY ALL HELPED ME GET HOME

00:02:30.376 --> 00:02:32.601
QUICKER AND SAFER.

00:02:32.635 --> 00:02:35.546
THEY WERE PUTTING PRESSURE ON

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.082
THE LOCAL BRIDGETOWN AND

00:02:37.117 --> 00:02:38.304
BARBADOS GOVERNMENT, WORKING

00:02:38.305 --> 00:02:39.987
WITH THE U.S. STATE DEPARTMENT

00:02:39.988 --> 00:02:41.701
AND U.S. EMBASSY IN BRIDGETOWN

00:02:41.703 --> 00:02:43.205
TO ARRANGE A CHARTER FLIGHT TO

00:02:43.206 --> 00:02:44.702
BRING BACK AMERICAN CITIZENS AND

00:02:44.703 --> 00:02:46.313
I WAS ONE OF THOSE LUCKY

00:02:46.347 --> 00:02:47.371
AMERICANS THAT GOT TO COME HOME

00:02:47.372 --> 00:02:48.112
ON THAT FLIGHT.

00:02:48.114 --> 00:02:49.152
GRIFF:

00:02:49.187 --> 00:02:51.867
PETE:.PETE:  WHAT WOULD IT HAVE

00:02:51.868 --> 00:02:54.907
LIKE IF YOU DIDN’T HAVE A

00:02:54.942 --> 00:02:56.572
CONGRESSMAN ABLE TO WEIGH IN FOR

00:02:56.607 --> 00:02:57.093
YOU.

00:02:57.095 --> 00:02:58.475
COULD YOU OTHERWISE STILL BE

00:02:58.476 --> 00:02:59.129
STUCK?

00:02:59.164 --> 00:03:02.248
&gt;&gt; I THINK WITHOUT CONGRESSMAN

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:04.852
NUNES AND HIS AMAZING STAFF IN

00:03:04.886 --> 00:03:07.255
CALIFORNIA, I WOULD NOT BE HERE

00:03:07.256 --> 00:03:08.646
RIGHT NOW IN SUNNY SAN DIEGO.

00:03:08.647 --> 00:03:10.522
I WOULD BE STUCK ON THAT SHIP

00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:11.814
LIKE MANY OF MY FRIENDS ARE

00:03:11.848 --> 00:03:12.688
STILL STUCK ON SHIPS AROUND THE

00:03:12.689 --> 00:03:13.453
WORLD.

00:03:13.487 --> 00:03:16.409
SO I’M VERY THANKFUL TO BE BACK.

00:03:16.444 --> 00:03:18.479
JEDEDIAH:  CONGRESSMAN, WHAT HAS

00:03:18.514 --> 00:03:20.451
IT MEANT FOR YOU TO BE ABLE TO

00:03:20.452 --> 00:03:21.511
HELP BRING RYAN HOME.

00:03:21.512 --> 00:03:23.883
&gt;&gt;  IT’S ONE OF THE REALLY ONLY

00:03:23.884 --> 00:03:25.958
GOOD PARTS LEFT ABOUT THIS JOB,

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:28.930
IS A LOT OF TIMES WE’RE THE LAST

00:03:28.932 --> 00:03:30.458
LINE WHEN PEOPLE GET TO US,

00:03:30.493 --> 00:03:31.686
WE’RE THEIR LAST HOPE.

00:03:31.721 --> 00:03:33.414
AND WE’VE HAD A LOT OF PEOPLE IN

00:03:33.415 --> 00:03:35.147
RYAN’S CASE, ALL THE MEMBERS OF

00:03:35.182 --> 00:03:37.484
CONGRESS ALL OVER THE COUNTRY

00:03:37.519 --> 00:03:39.026
HAVE HAD SIMILAR SITUATIONS, BUT

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:40.406
RYAN’S WAS PARTICULARLY

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:41.758
IMPORTANT BECAUSE IT TOOK SO

00:03:41.759 --> 00:03:42.087
LONG.

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:43.832
AND I’M ACTUALLY THANKFUL THAT

00:03:43.865 --> 00:03:45.893
HE DID GET BACK AND I WISH HE

00:03:45.927 --> 00:03:47.629
WOULD HAVE GOT BACK A LOT SOONER

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.177
TO BE WITH HIS FAMILY BACK HERE

00:03:49.178 --> 00:03:50.213
