00:03:50.247 --> 00:03:53.338
BUT WE STILL HAVE SOME PEOPLE

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:54.771
STILL OVERSEAS, TRAPPED OVERSEAS

00:03:54.805 --> 00:03:56.536
WHO CAN’T GET HOME.

00:03:56.571 --> 00:03:57.873
WE’RE STILL WORKING ON THOSE

00:03:57.907 --> 00:03:58.103
