00:03:58.104 --> 00:03:59.413
PETE:  I KNOW THIS IS NOT

00:03:59.448 --> 00:04:00.994
RELATED TO THE CRUISE SHIP BUT

00:04:00.995 --> 00:04:02.383
ANY UPDATES ON THE

