00:04:36.918 --> 00:04:39.750
IT’S REALLY UNPRECEDENTED TO SEE

00:04:39.751 --> 00:04:42.646
SOMEONE TAKE IT UPON THEMSELF TO

00:04:42.647 --> 00:04:44.107
BE THE JUDGE, JURY AND

00:04:44.108 --> 00:04:44.389
