00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.511
SO WE’RE CONTINUING TO MONITOR.

00:04:49.512 --> 00:04:52.212
ONE OF THE THINGS WE’RE WORKING

00:04:52.213 --> 00:04:54.307
ON IS LOOKING AT THE MUELLER

