REFERRALS BASED ON WHAT OCCURRED

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:02.502
DURING THAT MUELLER PROSECUTION.

00:05:02.536 --> 00:05:03.767
PETE:  RYAN, WE’RE GLAD YOU’RE

00:05:03.768 --> 00:05:04.259
BACK.

00:05:04.293 --> 00:05:05.749
ENJOY SUNNY SAN DIEGO.

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:07.396
HOPEFULLY YOU CAN GO TO THE

00:05:07.431 --> 00:05:08.781
BEACH EVENTUALLY.

